r><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Its easier to break it into two groups because of the way dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#800\"> and the cumsum function work</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><br></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
